WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.828
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.098 --> 01:51.690
[Episode 11]

3
01:52.480 --> 01:53.760
You're awake.

4
01:53.760 --> 01:56.040
The examination results show that you're fine.

5
01:56.040 --> 01:57.840
It's just a mild concussion.

6
01:57.840 --> 02:01.100
Do you feel any other discomfort?

7
02:01.719 --> 02:03.400
I'm a little dizzy.

8
02:03.400 --> 02:05.560
I see. Dizziness is normal.

9
02:05.560 --> 02:07.200
As long as you don't feel too nauseous,

10
02:07.200 --> 02:08.359
it's not a big problem.

11
02:08.359 --> 02:10.076
Rest well.

12
02:27.120 --> 02:28.580
Doctor.

13
02:29.240 --> 02:32.280
I feel like my memory is a little blurry.

14
02:32.280 --> 02:35.520
I can't remember what happened in the last six months.

15
02:35.520 --> 02:37.000
Your memory?

16
02:37.000 --> 02:39.000
Judging from the scans,

17
02:39.000 --> 02:42.080
the memory area doesn't seem to be damaged.

18
02:42.080 --> 02:45.240
However, the human brain is a mysterious thing.

19
02:45.240 --> 02:49.440
Severe shock or trauma can both affect your memory.

20
02:49.440 --> 02:52.180
Maybe you'll recover after some rest.

21
02:53.720 --> 02:56.600
But to be honest, given your current condition,

22
02:56.600 --> 02:59.699
there's no effective treatment right now.

23
03:08.359 --> 03:10.440
Shen Mo.

24
03:10.440 --> 03:12.639
Shen Mo, open the door!

25
03:15.919 --> 03:18.199
You're Shen Mo, right?

26
03:18.199 --> 03:19.800
Yes.

27
03:19.800 --> 03:21.160
I only rented this place to you so cheaply

28
03:21.160 --> 03:22.799
because I saw how hard it was for a fresh graduate.

29
03:22.799 --> 03:25.000
I can't believe I trusted you.

30
03:25.000 --> 03:27.679
Look at how much rent you owe.

31
03:27.679 --> 03:30.060
This is going too far.

32
03:34.400 --> 03:36.259
I'm sorry.

33
03:36.880 --> 03:38.400
I injured my hand a while ago,

34
03:38.400 --> 03:40.040
and I haven't been able to find a job.

35
03:40.040 --> 03:42.199
Can you give me a few more days?

36
03:42.199 --> 03:43.879
How much more can I accommodate you?

37
03:45.079 --> 03:46.199
Pack up your things.

38
03:46.199 --> 03:48.320
You need to move out.

39
03:48.320 --> 03:49.759
Please, just give me a little more time.

40
03:49.759 --> 03:51.440
I can't move out yet. I'm still waiting...

41
03:51.440 --> 03:53.720
Enough. Don't say another word.

42
03:53.720 --> 03:56.120
You have two days to pack your things.

43
03:56.120 --> 03:58.120
I'll be back in two days to take the house back.

44
03:58.120 --> 03:59.990
Hurry it up!

45
04:13.000 --> 04:14.579
Wait.

46
04:15.680 --> 04:18.019
What is it, Mr. Ji?

47
04:18.986 --> 04:20.925
Drive forward a little more.

48
04:23.480 --> 04:25.065
Stop here.

49
04:55.080 --> 04:56.319
It sounds beautiful.

50
04:56.319 --> 04:59.359
Then I'll sing it for you often, okay?

51
04:59.359 --> 05:00.527
Okay.

52
05:03.919 --> 05:05.500
Let's go.

53
05:11.640 --> 05:13.219
Stop.

54
05:26.119 --> 05:27.960
Shen Mo.

55
05:27.960 --> 05:29.476
I want to see you.

56
05:40.283 --> 05:41.738
Hello.

57
05:41.738 --> 05:43.599
Who are you?

58
05:48.793 --> 05:50.840
I'm sorry.

59
05:50.840 --> 05:51.847
I have the wrong person.

60
05:51.847 --> 05:53.640
Oh, it's okay.

61
05:53.640 --> 05:56.040
Do you know where the previous tenant went?

62
05:56.040 --> 05:57.239
I'm not sure.

63
05:57.239 --> 05:59.600
I heard the landlord mention it once.

64
05:59.600 --> 06:02.420
I think he left because he couldn't pay the rent.

65
06:03.540 --> 06:04.973
I see.

66
06:32.080 --> 06:33.479
So...

67
06:33.479 --> 06:36.300
In the end, I'm still homeless.

68
06:46.560 --> 06:48.560
Drop everything you're doing.

69
06:48.560 --> 06:50.200
Find Shen Mo for me.

70
06:50.200 --> 06:51.819
Now!

71
07:03.278 --> 07:06.060
Yes. I'm from T University's Department of Fine Arts.

72
07:07.520 --> 07:09.640
But I might not be able to paint now.

73
07:09.640 --> 07:11.940
However, I can do anything else.

74
07:13.960 --> 07:16.540
All right. Thank you.

75
07:26.160 --> 07:27.740
Who is it?

76
07:36.479 --> 07:38.200
Mr. Ji.

77
07:38.200 --> 07:40.540
How do you know I live here?

78
07:41.720 --> 07:43.120
You...

79
07:48.040 --> 07:50.100
You remember who I am?

80
07:52.479 --> 07:55.119
You're Ji An An's brother.

81
07:55.119 --> 07:56.600
Back then,

82
07:56.600 --> 07:59.520
didn't you pay for my medical bills after my accident?

83
07:59.520 --> 08:01.640
Speaking of which, I really must thank you.

84
08:01.640 --> 08:04.980
If it weren't for you, I wouldn't have known how to pay those bills.

85
08:06.359 --> 08:08.452
Don't just stand there. Come in.

86
08:08.452 --> 08:10.193
Please, come in.

87
08:11.880 --> 08:14.100
I'm sorry, my place...

88
08:15.040 --> 08:16.559
It's indeed a bit shabby.

89
08:16.559 --> 08:18.520
I haven't really tidied up.

90
08:18.520 --> 08:20.699
Here, have a seat.

91
08:29.200 --> 08:31.740
How did you end up like this?

92
08:32.360 --> 08:34.079
My hand was injured, remember?

93
08:34.079 --> 08:36.040
I haven't been able to find a job.

94
08:36.040 --> 08:38.199
I'm way behind on rent,

95
08:38.199 --> 08:40.739
so I'm just staying here for now.

96
08:46.799 --> 08:49.000
Take this for now.

97
08:49.000 --> 08:51.280
No, I can't.

98
08:51.280 --> 08:54.640
I already owe you a huge favor for my medical bills.

99
08:54.640 --> 08:57.160
If you give me more money...

100
08:57.160 --> 08:58.760
First, I won't be able to pay you back,

101
08:58.760 --> 09:01.148
and second, I'd be too ashamed to take it.

102
09:01.148 --> 09:02.539
Just take it.

103
09:02.539 --> 09:04.240
You don't have to pay me back.

104
09:05.760 --> 09:07.415
No, really.

105
09:07.415 --> 09:08.520
I'm able-bodied.

106
09:08.520 --> 09:10.640
I can earn money anywhere.

107
09:10.640 --> 09:12.255
Besides, I'm only here temporarily.

108
09:12.255 --> 09:16.140
It may look shabby, but it's actually not that bad.

109
09:17.532 --> 09:19.392
Fine, you don't have to take it.

110
09:20.668 --> 09:21.790
How about this?

111
09:21.790 --> 09:23.880
Pack your things and come with me.

112
09:23.880 --> 09:25.510
I'll arrange a place for you to stay.

113
09:25.510 --> 09:28.000
You can move out once you've made money.

114
09:28.000 --> 09:31.160
I appreciate your kindness, really.

115
09:31.160 --> 09:34.520
I don't know why you're being so nice to me,

116
09:34.520 --> 09:37.580
but I really can't accept all this.

117
09:38.293 --> 09:40.673
Thank you, Mr. Ji.

118
09:42.366 --> 09:43.786
Oh.

119
09:44.679 --> 09:46.579
I see.

120
09:52.240 --> 09:54.420
What if I give you a job?

121
09:55.200 --> 09:58.440
It's not charity, nor is it an ordinary job.

122
09:58.440 --> 10:00.380
Would you be willing to do it?

123
10:32.799 --> 10:35.380
Is this the power of the Ji family?

124
10:40.753 --> 10:42.452
Take a look.

125
10:43.440 --> 10:45.299
What is this?

126
10:45.986 --> 10:48.046
Be my lover.

127
10:49.759 --> 10:51.380
What?

128
10:52.879 --> 10:55.400
Be my contract lover.

129
10:55.400 --> 10:57.979
What you're holding is the contract.

130
11:04.840 --> 11:06.260
Me?

131
11:07.080 --> 11:09.600
A contract lover?

132
11:09.600 --> 11:12.200
You and Zhou Yang had a past.

133
11:12.200 --> 11:16.299
I don't trust you, nor do I trust Zhou Yang.

134
11:17.280 --> 11:20.360
To ensure Zhou Yang stays with my sister,

135
11:20.360 --> 11:22.480
and to make him give up on you,

136
11:22.480 --> 11:25.380
the best way is to keep an eye on you.

137
11:26.120 --> 11:31.400
And the best way to do that is to keep you by my side

138
11:31.400 --> 11:33.440
as my lover.

139
11:33.440 --> 11:35.399
And I can also use you

140
11:35.399 --> 11:38.920
to ward off the advances of some boring guys out there.

141
11:38.920 --> 11:40.040
Everyone wins.

142
11:40.040 --> 11:42.639
I... I don't think this is a good idea.

143
11:42.639 --> 11:44.659
Do you have an objection?

144
11:46.040 --> 11:47.760
You'll get your share of benefits.

145
11:47.760 --> 11:50.120
It's all clearly stated in the contract.

146
11:50.120 --> 11:53.219
If you have any requests, feel free to ask.

147
11:54.280 --> 11:55.760
That's not what I meant.

148
11:55.760 --> 11:58.160
Then what do you mean?

149
11:58.160 --> 12:00.640
I already owe Mr. Ji so much.

150
12:00.640 --> 12:03.520
He wants to ensure his sister's happiness by doing this.

151
12:03.520 --> 12:05.080
I...

152
12:05.080 --> 12:07.760
I'm just a homeless, useless person.

153
12:07.760 --> 12:10.480
What right do I have to refuse?

154
12:10.480 --> 12:14.020
Besides... Zhou Yang...

155
12:18.640 --> 12:20.640
Fine.

156
12:20.640 --> 12:23.240
Since I'm the redundant one,

157
12:23.240 --> 12:26.020
I might as well sell myself for a good price.

158
12:40.719 --> 12:43.040
You'll live here from now on.

159
12:43.040 --> 12:45.242
You can pick any room you like.

160
12:45.242 --> 12:49.606
Once you've chosen a room, go take a shower.

161
13:15.000 --> 13:16.639
This "lover" role...

162
13:16.639 --> 13:18.440
It's just a title, right?

163
13:18.440 --> 13:20.920
Mr. Ji shouldn't want to do anything to me, right?

164
13:20.920 --> 13:21.920
He probably won't.

165
13:21.920 --> 13:23.919
I'm sure he's not interested in me.

166
13:23.919 --> 13:26.399
But... if he wants to,

167
13:26.399 --> 13:28.440
I can't really refuse, can I?

168
13:28.440 --> 13:30.159
After all, I've signed the contract.

169
13:30.159 --> 13:31.600
My body...

170
13:31.600 --> 13:32.919
should be included

171
13:32.919 --> 13:35.299
in this lover's contract, right?

172
13:40.680 --> 13:42.220
Come here.

173
13:48.825 --> 13:50.806
Take off your clothes.

174
14:35.113 --> 14:37.653
You haven't even dried yourself off.

175
14:58.219 --> 15:00.479
We signed a contract, didn't we?

176
15:03.120 --> 15:05.779
So, we're lovers now, right?

177
15:08.053 --> 15:09.672
Yeah.

178
15:19.120 --> 15:20.520
Take it off.

179
15:30.480 --> 15:31.979
Call my name...

180
15:34.586 --> 15:36.006
Mr. Ji.

181
15:36.920 --> 15:38.940
Call me "Ming Xuan".

182
15:40.040 --> 15:41.600
Ming Xuan.

183
15:41.600 --> 15:43.220
Louder.

184
15:48.360 --> 15:49.980
Ming Xuan.

185
15:55.919 --> 15:57.860
Ming Xuan.

186
16:21.480 --> 16:23.480
Mr. Ji is so experienced.

187
16:23.480 --> 16:26.760
He must despise my poor performance.

188
16:26.760 --> 16:29.039
Oh, Shen Mo...

189
16:29.039 --> 16:32.380
You're not even qualified to be his outlet.

190
16:41.039 --> 16:42.279
Mr. Ji.

191
16:42.279 --> 16:44.360
Breakfast is ready.

192
16:44.360 --> 16:46.365
I'll skip breakfast.

193
16:46.365 --> 16:48.586
I have an urgent meeting to attend.

194
16:52.040 --> 16:53.603
Open it.

195
16:53.603 --> 16:55.260
This is...

196
16:56.640 --> 16:58.232
A ring I had my secretary buy.

197
16:58.232 --> 17:00.333
We have to play the part fully.

198
17:04.079 --> 17:06.319
I didn't expect Mr. Ji to lie.

199
17:06.319 --> 17:08.759
This clearly isn't a new ring.

200
17:08.759 --> 17:10.839
A big boss like him...

201
17:10.839 --> 17:13.459
And he can't even afford a new ring?

202
17:14.400 --> 17:16.300
I'm off to work.

203
17:23.680 --> 17:26.219
Why does it fit so well?

204
17:29.294 --> 17:33.771
[Four years later]

205
17:54.440 --> 17:56.400
Since An An's accident,

206
17:56.400 --> 17:59.000
Mr. Ji has been gone for four years.

207
17:59.000 --> 18:00.440
Ironically,

208
18:00.440 --> 18:03.160
I was Mr. Ji's contract lover for three years.

209
18:03.160 --> 18:05.320
It wasn't until the day he left...

210
18:05.320 --> 18:09.060
that I remembered everything at Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

211
18:44.759 --> 18:46.440
Oh, boss.

212
18:46.440 --> 18:48.699
Slacking off again?

213
18:52.920 --> 18:54.279
Sorry.

214
18:54.279 --> 18:55.680
I'm back late.

215
18:55.680 --> 18:58.159
I didn't delay your date with your partner, did I?

216
18:58.920 --> 19:01.240
I wonder which of us is the boss.

217
19:01.240 --> 19:03.760
I feel like I care more about the studio than you do.

218
19:03.760 --> 19:05.280
Oh, please.

219
19:05.280 --> 19:07.760
It's true, though.

220
19:07.760 --> 19:10.639
In a blink, you're a senior employee.

221
19:10.639 --> 19:13.040
Four years. Time flies.

222
19:13.040 --> 19:14.159
Exactly.

223
19:14.159 --> 19:16.960
I've been here since the studio opened.

224
19:16.960 --> 19:18.720
I wanted some peace and quiet,

225
19:18.720 --> 19:21.920
but I didn't expect it to be this quiet.

226
19:21.920 --> 19:25.119
But then again, it's been four years.

227
19:25.119 --> 19:27.480
I've never seen you date anyone.

228
19:27.480 --> 19:30.000
Boss, you're already 30.

229
19:30.000 --> 19:31.399
You should start dating.

230
19:31.399 --> 19:33.680
I'll only be 29 after the New Year.

231
19:33.680 --> 19:35.639
It's the same thing.

232
19:35.639 --> 19:37.119
Listen.

233
19:37.119 --> 19:38.280
The older you get,

234
19:38.280 --> 19:40.817
the less popular you are in the dating market.

235
19:41.839 --> 19:43.920
Where did you learn that from?

236
19:43.920 --> 19:46.040
Come on, I'm being serious.

237
19:46.040 --> 19:48.200
Do you want me to set you up with someone?

238
19:48.200 --> 19:50.280
- Actually, I have a college classmate... - Stop right there.

239
19:50.280 --> 19:52.159
No, thanks.

240
19:52.159 --> 19:53.192
What?

241
19:53.192 --> 19:57.079
Is there someone in your heart?

242
19:57.079 --> 19:58.839
Someone you've been waiting for in silence?

243
19:58.839 --> 20:02.319
Did you lock your heart away after a breakup?

244
20:02.319 --> 20:04.520
Was it your first love?

245
20:04.520 --> 20:06.520
- Yes. - Or was it a secret crush?

246
20:06.520 --> 20:09.599
Oh! A goddess you've pursued for years?

247
20:09.599 --> 20:11.990
No. Stop guessing.

248
20:16.240 --> 20:18.639
Boss, my guy is here to pick me up.

249
20:18.639 --> 20:19.799
I'm heading out. Bye!

250
20:19.799 --> 20:20.962
Go on.

251
20:22.440 --> 20:27.200
Boss, I believe you'll definitely win over that person.

252
20:27.200 --> 20:28.739
Good luck!

253
20:45.880 --> 20:48.440
I painted so many works over those years.

254
20:48.440 --> 20:51.160
That person must have put in so much effort

255
20:51.160 --> 20:53.620
to collect them all.

256
20:55.618 --> 20:58.586
[Calendar 2026]

257
21:20.880 --> 21:22.240
I'm going away for a bit next week.

258
21:22.240 --> 21:24.219
I'll leave the studio to you.

259
21:24.960 --> 21:28.160
Boss, are you going on a trip again?

260
21:28.160 --> 21:30.039
You get to go away every year at this time.

261
21:30.039 --> 21:31.599
I'm so jealous.

262
21:31.599 --> 21:32.960
What do you mean "trip"?

263
21:32.960 --> 21:34.759
I'm going out to find inspiration.

264
21:34.759 --> 21:37.799
Artists need inspiration to paint.

265
21:37.799 --> 21:41.000
Then when will you let me go out to find some inspiration too,

266
21:41.000 --> 21:42.559
my dear boss?

267
21:42.559 --> 21:45.119
Fine. I'll give you your annual leave when I get back.

268
21:45.119 --> 21:46.679
How's that?

269
21:46.679 --> 21:49.559
Really? It's a deal then.

270
21:49.559 --> 21:52.720
My dear boss, where are you going this time?

271
21:52.720 --> 21:54.939
Where are you looking for inspiration?

272
21:55.680 --> 21:57.459
The usual place.

273
21:58.320 --> 22:00.766
M Island again?

274
22:00.766 --> 22:02.839
That's a honeymoon destination.

275
22:02.839 --> 22:05.799
Couples go there together, okay?

276
22:05.799 --> 22:08.360
You're a lifelong bachelor.

277
22:08.360 --> 22:11.680
Why do you go there every year?

278
22:11.680 --> 22:14.419
Looking for a fling, or trying to steal someone's partner?

279
22:15.160 --> 22:17.919
I wonder what's going on in that head of yours every day.

280
22:17.919 --> 22:20.536
I told you, I'm looking for inspiration.

281
22:21.840 --> 22:23.866
You go there every spring.

282
22:23.866 --> 22:26.058
I don't believe there isn't a special reason.

283
22:26.058 --> 22:27.599
What special reason could there be?

284
22:27.599 --> 22:29.240
"The whole year's work depends on a good start in spring."

285
22:29.240 --> 22:31.919
Everything awakens in spring.

286
22:31.919 --> 22:33.639
It's the best time to go out.

287
22:33.639 --> 22:36.639
"The whole year's work depends on a good start in spring."

288
22:36.639 --> 22:40.099
Boss, I think you're just in heat.

289
22:42.440 --> 22:45.160
I think you don't want your salary anymore.

290
22:45.160 --> 22:46.400
I'm sorry, I'm really sorry!

291
22:46.400 --> 22:47.519
I'm sorry, boss.

292
22:47.519 --> 22:49.359
Please be magnanimous.

293
22:49.359 --> 22:51.079
- Forgive my insolence. - Go on.

294
22:51.079 --> 22:52.520
Get back to work.

295
22:52.520 --> 22:54.341
Slave driver.

296
23:00.519 --> 23:02.200
It's been four years.

297
23:02.200 --> 23:05.319
The days have just passed by like this.

298
23:05.319 --> 23:08.820
I used to yearn for a life like this.

299
23:21.720 --> 23:23.759
At this very moment four years ago,

300
23:23.759 --> 23:26.160
if those things hadn't happened,

301
23:26.160 --> 23:29.380
I would've gone to M Island with Ji Ming Xuan.

302
23:30.839 --> 23:33.499
Maybe we were just never meant to be.

303
23:36.303 --> 23:38.548
[VIP Passage]

304
23:49.200 --> 23:50.600
This way, please.

305
23:52.319 --> 23:53.880
Welcome to SEAMO Hotel.

306
23:53.880 --> 23:55.480
This is your room.

307
23:55.480 --> 23:58.240
Our hotel's investor is also Chinese.

308
23:58.240 --> 24:00.519
So, in the overall design of the hotel,

309
24:00.519 --> 24:02.400
there are many of his own designs.

310
24:02.400 --> 24:04.759
We hope to provide you with an experience like home.

311
24:04.759 --> 24:07.319
If you have any needs, please feel free to contact me.

312
24:07.319 --> 24:09.520
Enjoy your stay.

313
24:09.520 --> 24:12.000
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

314
24:48.039 --> 24:49.839
Mr. Ji.

315
24:49.839 --> 24:52.079
Where are you?

316
24:52.079 --> 24:54.540
Where are you looking at the moon now?

317
25:13.440 --> 25:15.140
Ming Xuan.

318
25:16.520 --> 25:18.840
Ming Xuan, come here quickly.

319
25:20.880 --> 25:22.540
Coming!

320
25:26.240 --> 25:27.359
Let's go over there.

321
25:27.359 --> 25:28.759
Okay.

322
25:31.559 --> 25:33.920
I wonder how Ji Ming Xuan is doing now.

323
25:33.920 --> 25:35.979
Has he changed at all?

324
25:36.800 --> 25:40.459
But... I probably won't see him again in this lifetime.

325
25:52.480 --> 25:54.700
I'm sorry.

326
25:55.720 --> 25:57.360
I'm sorry.

327
25:57.360 --> 25:58.979
I'm sorry.

328
26:02.200 --> 26:03.900
Mr. Ji.

329
26:05.060 --> 26:06.759
Come with me.

330
26:25.079 --> 26:26.939
Mr. Ji, that's enough.

331
26:29.759 --> 26:31.620
Rinse it a bit longer.

332
26:41.920 --> 26:43.699
You haven't changed much.

333
26:46.066 --> 26:48.205
Neither have you, Mr. Ji.

334
27:01.739 --> 27:03.912
Come to my room first.

335
27:03.912 --> 27:05.852
I'll go get you some medicine.

336
27:40.378 --> 27:42.359
I'm on vacation on M Island.

337
27:44.519 --> 27:46.560
I've started painting again.

338
27:46.560 --> 27:48.680
I came here to find some inspiration.

339
27:54.465 --> 27:56.912
Are you here alone?

340
27:56.912 --> 27:59.119
Yes.

341
27:59.119 --> 28:01.850
I'm the only one with free time.

342
28:01.850 --> 28:03.440
When did you arrive?

343
28:03.440 --> 28:05.079
A few days ago.

344
28:05.079 --> 28:07.326
What about you?

345
28:07.326 --> 28:09.105
I've been here for a while.

346
28:16.560 --> 28:18.079
There, all done.

347
28:18.079 --> 28:19.499
Thanks.

348
28:23.200 --> 28:24.598
Young Master.

349
28:24.598 --> 28:26.538
Daddy!

350
28:27.400 --> 28:28.480
Speak Chinese.

351
28:28.480 --> 28:30.180
Dad!

352
28:30.840 --> 28:31.840
Come here.

353
28:31.840 --> 28:33.218
Say hello to Mr. Shen.

354
28:33.218 --> 28:35.197
Hello, sir.

355
28:37.920 --> 28:39.499
Hello there.

356
28:39.499 --> 28:40.781
What's your name?

357
28:40.781 --> 28:43.197
Ji Ning.

358
28:46.160 --> 28:47.226
Hello, Xiao Ning.

359
28:47.226 --> 28:49.405
How old are you this year?

360
28:50.200 --> 28:51.940
You're three?

361
28:53.233 --> 28:56.040
Sir, play with me.

362
28:56.040 --> 28:57.079
Be good.

363
28:57.079 --> 28:59.540
His hand is hurt.

364
29:00.493 --> 29:02.112
Chen.

365
29:02.812 --> 29:05.640
Young Master, let's go out and play.

366
29:08.640 --> 29:11.459
Bye, sir.

367
29:14.640 --> 29:17.200
Are you here on vacation too, Mr. Ji?

368
29:22.805 --> 29:24.745
I'm here for business.

369
29:25.720 --> 29:27.160
There was no one to look after Ji Ning,

370
29:27.160 --> 29:28.640
so I brought him along.

371
29:28.640 --> 29:30.352
I see.

372
29:30.352 --> 29:33.840
I didn't know you were married, Mr. Ji.

373
29:33.840 --> 29:35.540
Congratulations.

374
29:44.178 --> 29:45.878
And you?

375
29:49.279 --> 29:51.500
Did you get back together with Zhou Yang?

376
29:54.032 --> 29:56.852
We haven't seen each other in years.

377
29:58.607 --> 30:00.880
- Oh, I thought... - When are you...

378
30:00.880 --> 30:02.700
Daddy!

379
30:05.205 --> 30:06.647
It's getting late.

380
30:06.647 --> 30:08.285
I should head back now.

381
30:08.285 --> 30:10.119
Go and tend to your son.

382
30:10.119 --> 30:11.860
Go back to your room.

383
30:14.079 --> 30:16.300
Let's have dinner tonight.

384
30:18.072 --> 30:19.592
I have to paint in the evenings.

385
30:19.592 --> 30:22.373
I hate being interrupted when I'm inspired.

386
30:22.373 --> 30:24.680
Tomorrow, then.

387
30:24.680 --> 30:25.812
Okay.

388
30:25.812 --> 30:27.752
We'll talk tomorrow.

389
30:31.919 --> 30:33.779
Thank you.

390
30:59.680 --> 31:00.880
Mr. Ji sent this for you.

391
31:00.880 --> 31:03.307
He specifically asked you to change your dressing.

392
31:03.307 --> 31:05.039
Oh.

393
31:05.039 --> 31:06.738
Thank you.

394
31:14.178 --> 31:16.531
[Apply the medication every two hours until the swelling subsides.]

395
31:18.920 --> 31:20.193
Mr. Ji...

396
31:20.193 --> 31:22.732
He's still the same as before.

397
31:44.060 --> 31:45.520
Daddy.

398
31:45.520 --> 31:49.240
Why aren't you asleep yet?

399
31:49.240 --> 31:50.640
Xiao Ning.

400
32:01.640 --> 32:03.762
Because I thought of someone...

401
32:03.762 --> 32:05.843
Someone I've known for a very long time.

402
32:05.843 --> 32:10.023
Do you miss him, Daddy?

403
32:12.560 --> 32:16.900
Whether I miss him or not, it's all in the past now.

404
32:18.560 --> 32:21.425
Xiao Ning, time for bed.

405
32:21.425 --> 32:22.440
Be good.

406
32:22.440 --> 32:23.820
Okay.

407
33:05.753 --> 33:07.573
Ji Ming Xuan...

408
33:30.232 --> 33:33.034
I once held that person's heart,

409
33:33.034 --> 33:36.113
but in the end, I let go.

410
33:36.113 --> 33:39.794
If I'd remembered those six months sooner,

411
33:39.794 --> 33:42.055
would things have been different?

412
33:44.080 --> 33:45.339
Forget it.

413
33:45.339 --> 33:48.061
Some people and some things,

414
33:48.061 --> 33:50.562
once missed, are gone forever.

415
34:04.566 --> 34:06.371
Hello, Yang Yue.

416
34:06.371 --> 34:07.400
What's up, boss?

417
34:07.400 --> 34:08.560
Why are you calling me so early?

418
34:08.560 --> 34:10.260
Any orders for me?

419
34:12.378 --> 34:14.520
I forgot about the time difference.

420
34:14.520 --> 34:15.563
Help me book a ticket.

421
34:15.563 --> 34:17.324
I'm going back.

422
34:17.324 --> 34:19.360
Remember to tidy up the studio.

423
34:19.360 --> 34:22.698
Huh? Why are you planning to return early?

424
34:22.698 --> 34:24.859
There's no need to stay any longer.

425
34:25.600 --> 34:28.440
Did something... upset you?

426
34:29.459 --> 34:30.859
No.

427
34:32.700 --> 34:34.885
Quite the opposite.

428
34:34.885 --> 34:37.128
I'm too happy.

429
34:37.128 --> 34:40.549
So... it's enough.
